            "review_text": "phuc t\n2 contributions\n0\nSaigon Local Brewery with a beautiful craft beer garden\nJul 2023 • Friends\nThis is an absolute gem in the Tan Dinh ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh city. The space is huge with a beautiful green outdoor garden, and an elegant indoor area. Their menu consists of 8 beers on tap and loads of delicious Vietnamese dishes. Everything goes well together, from the vibe, music, food and beer. I strongly recommend checking this spot out.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 31, 2023",
